{"productId": "ab0ac88c-9ffb-4edd-b3ab-f4eea92405f7", "modelName": "EPC", "modelDescription": "Bringing the heavy, match-grade barrel from our Officer-size ECO to a bit bigger platform, the Enhanced Commander Pistol 45A is a 4\" gun that conceals well but is a tack-driver at the range. With a compact, stainless steel slide and a forged aluminum frame, weight is kept to a svelte 29 oz. Our new tapered G10 grips and a bobtailed frame enhance its ergonomics, affording shooters with smaller hands an easier reach to the trigger. A tri-topped slide wears aggressive side serrations and a top rib to knock down glare, while our new U-notch rear sight is matched to our brass-beaded front sight. The bull barrel itself is flush-cut to make for easier disassembly and has a 30 degree crown. With a similar recoil system to the ECO, it has a flat wire recoil spring that is rated for 15,000 rounds, three times the round count of a typical 1911 dual recoil spring setup.", "manufacturerName": "Dan Wesson", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "7429cc15-a449-48e4-a0ba-2d30ff340d91", "description": "Dan Wesson, EPC, 9mm Luger Caliber, 4\" Bull Barrel, 9+1 Capacity, Black Finish Bobtail Frame, Serrated Black Duty Stainless Steel Slide & Black/Gray Tapered G10 Grip", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/73bf660e-e574-48a8-bb22-1a1d1b662424"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "01884", "upc": "806703018843", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "70cd5184-05d8-42f1-ace2-3bf16911e463", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "bb23c0a9-9d08-4b62-b022-2a505dd48109", "valueName": "4\""}, {"attributeNameId": "5484bfc3-10d4-4ad1-ba8b-bd2973f49143", "attributeName": "Color", "attributeValueId": "72f9effd-b731-4455-a587-2eed3d4aa887", "valueName": "Black"}, {"attributeNameId": "2fa81b83-a1b1-4729-b87f-fbaba467061c", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "f24c6332-06ca-4e4f-8dcb-1cf9ec77de74", "valueName": "9